[b]Dig down and build up a true multistory base — and let your colonists treat every level as one home.[/b]

[url=https://discord.gg/Vwh2y7qMXv]Discord[/url]  •  [url=https://azraelgodking.github.io/rimworld_mods/strata.html]Website[/url]  •  [url=https://azraelgodking.github.io/rimworld_mods/strata-roadmap.html]Roadmap[/url]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Build in every direction[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Excavated stairwells[/b] — full-size rock levels beneath your map, rotatable stairwells, thick rock roof protection.
[*][b]Tower stairwells[/b] — Level +N roof decks that expand as you roof the floor below. Page Up / Page Down to travel.
[*][b]Gravship decks (Odyssey)[/b] — linked upper and lower decks launch, fly, and land with the ship.
[/list]

[h2]One base, many floors[/h2]
Colonists don't treat a staircase like a map edge. Work, food, rest, hauling, and bills all reach across levels, with a Strata Levels toggle in the Work and Schedule tabs.

[h2]Living below[/h2]
[list]
[*]Shoring, airlocks, ore hoists, fungus farms, sump pumps, mine lamps, and lime scrubbers.
[*][b]Heat rises, cold falls[/b] — shafts exchange temperature, and buoyant or heavy gases drift through open shafts.
[/list]

[h2]Breathe deep[/h2]
[list]
[*]Smoke, deep gas, and O₂ / CO₂ simulation with a full gas overlay.
[*]Pumps, scrubbers, canaries, and gas pipes to keep the air survivable.
[*][b]Mine atmosphere[/b] — methane, black damp, spores, and steam, each with a counter.
[/list]

[h2]Fluid shafts[/h2]
Move plumbing, heating, coolant, helixien, chemfuel, and crude between floors — DBH, DCH, Rimatomics, and more.

[h2]Events and the deep[/h2]
Infestations, gas breaches, firestorms, deep sieges, quest sites, rich ore veins, and ancient stairheads.

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Requirements and notes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Requires [b]Harmony[/b]. Built for RimWorld [b]1.6[/b].
[*][b]Odyssey is optional[/b] — only the gravship deck features need it.
[*][b]Safe to add[/b] to an existing save.
[*]Power shafts carry electricity between levels.
[*]Performance: each open level is a live map. Settings include performance toggles if you run a deep stack on a modest machine.
[/list]

[h2]Compatible mods[/h2]
[list]
[*]Dubs Bad Hygiene
[*]Dubs Central Heating
[*]Rimatomics
[*]Rimefeller
[*]Vanilla Helixien Gas Expanded
[*]Vanilla Chemfuel Expanded
[*]Vanilla Temperature Expanded
[*]Vanilla Gravship Expanded — Chapter 1
[*]Biomes! Caverns (plus Biomes! Core)
[*]Geological Landforms
[*]Homesteader
[*]Stormproof
[*]Misc. Robots
[*]Deep And Deeper (and other cave / pocket-map mods) — their caves are invisible to Strata's cross-level relays by default; an optional setting ([i]Relay into other mods' portal maps[/i]) sends work/food/rest relays into them too
[/list]

[h2]Known incompatibilities[/h2]
[b]Strata will never be compatible with MultiFloors, Z-Levels, or As Above, So Below.[/b] It isn't personal — we all solve multi-level colonies in fundamentally different ways, and those approaches can't share a save.

